bandit lookout ~
a bandit lookout~
A bandit lookout has been stationed here.
~
This poor fellow got stuck on lookout duty. Judging from the small
canyons of darkness underneath his eyes, you infer he's been here for
quite a long time, and, faithful to his post, hasn't dozed off. He looks
like your average bandit, tattered clothes and tanned skin. Oddly
enough, he doesn't seem the least bit alarmed at your presence as an
outsider.
~
