#2401
desert bandit~
a desert bandit~
A desert bandit is here, cleaning his dagger.
~
He's your average, run of the mill bandit. He's not scrawny, but he's no
bodybuilder. He's probably a grunt for the bandits, the kind of guy that
gets setn along with the big dogs for strength in numbers. However, since
he's alone, you bet you could take him. He's cleaning something off of his
dagger, which is fashioned from stone. It's probably just his lunch, though,
as you can't imagine that this guy has killed anyone lately.
~
