#2402
sparring bandit~
a sparring bandit~
A rough young bandit stands here tapping his foot impatiently.
~
Newly inducted as a bandit, this guy is looking for someone with whom to
pick a fight, in hopes of honing his blade skills. As he impatiently waits
for an unknown guest, he slashes his blade around a bit in the air,
practicing his strokes. Upon meeting your glare, he sneers, disapproving of
you as a fight worth picking. Snobby little bastard. Give him what he's got
comin to him!
~
