#2403
rotund man bandit cook chef~
the bandit cook~
A rotund man in an apron is pacing around here, watching his stew.
~
Take a gourment chef, make him live in the desert for a few years with a 
group of bandits, and put him through a few mortal battles with wild animals
just to obtain the night's meal, and you've probably got this guy. He's about
the right size for a chef who rather enjoys his food, but one can't help but
wonder how much of this guy is actually muscle.
~
