#2404
dog mutt attacked trained~
an attack dog~
A trained attack dog sniffs at your feet and growls. 
~
A mutt beyond mutts, this dog is really like nothing you've ever seen. It's 
probably a mix of all the dogs you've ever seen, and a few you might never
have. The result? One ugly puppy. Its dark brown fur is ruffled all over, and
discolored on its long, though stockey, legs. But looks aside, it stands at
about three feet high, and looks to be awfully well fed. Also, no matter how
much of a mutt the dog is, its teeth are something that won't change much.
Teeth are teeth, and you'd prefer not to catch them in your leg.
~
