#2405
angry bandit mad furious~
an angry bandit~
A furious looking bandit is stalking around here, mad about something.
~
He's definitely cross. Maybe he just got assigned to work on lookout duty,
or maybe he just stubbed his toe on a rock, but whatever the reason, this
small-framed, short, dark haired bandit is hoppin mad. He stares right 
through you and doesn't notice you in front of him, which is probably a good
thing, since you're willing to bet he'd probably punch you if he did see you
there.
~
