#2407
Brianna leader bandit woman desert~
Brianna, leader of the desert bandits~
Brianna seems infuriated by your intrusion upon her privacy.
~
Brianna is tall, and has a surprisingly light complexion for a bandit, let
alone someone dwelling on the Xixieqi continent. Long blonde hair
accompanies piercing green eyes, and her pale skin looks as though its
never seen a day in the sun. How she manages that as a bandit, well, 
your guess is as good as any. She doesn't look overly strong, but for a 
woman to lead a group of bandits, she's got to be a pretty tough cookie.
She holds a single rose, taken from a cactus, close to her heart, even as 
she notices you and becomes a lot less pleased. She stops her day 
dreaming and the placid look on her face is now one of contempt and wrath, 
amongst other foul moods.
~
