#2410
bandit armorer~
the bandit armorer~
The bandit's armorer is here, tempering a sword.
~
The bandit armorer is one heck of a crafty fellow. If you give him his tools
and time to work, he could make a deadly weapon from a pile of rocks and
a bottle of firebreather. He's surprisingly thinner than the typical armorer, 
but his sleeve-less shirt reveals the well toned muscular arms you'd expect
to see from an armorer. He is well tanned, and is currently sweating, having
been tempering the stone sword you currently see in his hands. When he
sees you in his shop, he smiles and walks over to greet you, hoping to make
a sale.
~
